Subject: Cantor Phase3 Inventory Consistency Evidence Revision Data Design

Description: Unsigned Data-Driven Design quality-gate record for the cross-module evidence-vocabulary repair. It fixes data identities, representations, ownership, relations, cardinality, validation states, provenance boundaries, versioning, and failure behavior before canonical authority.

